{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "81b4c4ae-13e9-8746-834b-b9adf87a907a",
  "created_at": "2026-02-13T12:12:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Susan Chase",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:10:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:10:12-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise, hi. Okay, so my name is Susan Chase, and I'm calling from my cell, I'm at home today, and I should say I've lived here a few years now and I've never really noticed this before, but, um, there's been something going on out front for about a week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:10:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, what's going on out front?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:10:33-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So there's a pipe at the curb, and water just runs out of it. All day, every day. It's not raining, it hasn't rained, it's been dry and cold. And the water goes onto the sidewalk and freezes, so now it's a sheet of ice. And where it isn't ice, the sidewalk is a sheet of mud and grit, like everything the water drags along with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:10:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So a steady flow from a pipe at the curb, no storm involved. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:11:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sorry, yes. It's 348 Bliss Road. Easton's Beach side, so toward the water end, not up by the avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:11:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "348 Bliss Road. And is the water clear, or does it look dirty or smell like anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:11:19-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly clear, a little cloudy maybe. No smell that I can tell. I'm just worried because the mail carrier almost went down yesterday, and my neighbor is older and walks that way every morning. [pause] And I keep wondering if it's a broken main or just a drain thing, I really don't know which."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:11:38-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what we'll have to figure out. Could be a drainage line, could be a leak somewhere. I'll put in a request for a crew to go look at it. Meanwhile, if you've got sand or salt for the ice, that'd help for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:11:54-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do have some ice melt, I'll put it down. Sorry, this is a weird thing to say, but I'm sitting here wearing a hat indoors for no good reason, I don't know why, anyway. Sorry. Can someone call me back when it's done? Or at least when somebody's been out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:12:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Is the number I'm seeing on my screen the best one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:12:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's my cell, 401-555-0170."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:12:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0170, got it. I'll note it for a callback once the crew's looked at it. If it gets worse before then, or someone slips, call us right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:12:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you so much, Denise. I really appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:12:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good weekend, and watch your step out there."
    }
  ],
